	)
	(text "Start at 5 V / 1 A and 9 V / 1.9 A, subject to input budget.\nNo active-DFU voltage changes. Clear SEL9 with discharge on and eFuse off;\nwait 3 s (prototype setting), then connect eFuse and verify connector 5 V."
